title: '[pallet-revive] Enforce the storage deposit limit before recording the charge'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    `charge_deposit` now checks the storage deposit limit before recording a charge instead
    of recording it and resetting the whole meter on overflow. This keeps the transaction's
    other storage charges in place when a contract termination's deposit charge would exceed
    the limit, so those writes are charged and held rather than committed without a deposit.
crates:
- name: pallet-revive
  bump: patch
- name: pallet-revive-fixtures
  bump: minor
